ty. She is chosen because of her healing abilities, which are known as one of the best in the realm."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is levelheaded and reserved girl. She is from the same holy land as the Hero and an important figure to make contact with royal families of different countries."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c99857"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1f/1fddd72dde339b5735e2e92cd3b7a5a896bfb9c0a6201239b253f54c85cb9665.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/7028d4138d3470b6ec6e246987a219c2e1550759238846a2c6daf9f90faedda8.webp","width":184,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"櫻井 彩夏","creatorId":"vndb:s36720","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s36720","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s36720","name":"櫻井 彩夏","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:88076","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c99858","characterName":"ヒルダ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c99858"},"originalCharacterName":"ヒルダ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hilda is a member of the hero's party. She is the big sister of the party and is usually calm, but she can pack a powerful punch when she gets angry."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hilda is a serious woman who holds herself up to high standards. She takes it upon herself to become a teacher for the amnesiac Hero and the people of the realm."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c99858"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/88/88c6dd87ec60eb41bffeedbd61416944af6350e4531c88789580da2010815f55.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/33/33a88c3c555efa8d8fda29da0f1c5b29d4d3624e533c13e1589586f5f45ee8f1.webp","width":177,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"夏陽 りんこ","creatorId":"vndb:s24545","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s24545","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s24545","name":"夏陽 りんこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:88074","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c99859","characterName":"カロライン　ログヴェル","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c99859"},"originalCharacterName":"カロライン　ログヴェル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Carol's beautiful singing and dancing has helped her create a special niche in the hearts of the people. She actively cooperates with the city's vigilante groups and helps protect the people in place of an army of soldiers. Carol's sharp insight and judgement make her out to be a dependable figure, but there is more to her than meets the eye."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is known as the princess of Alard."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c99859"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fa/fa010839e0143496c01117f3160b697e3555b0a8c148692e441549d6023cd9c2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a2/a2ff67a26020d07d1f953dfd853c0bd6639200a7d86a0d9454b31243380dfd8f.webp","width":190,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"鈴木 麗子","creatorId":"vndb:s11784","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11784","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11784","name":"鈴木 麗子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:88072","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c99860","characterName":"アイビス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c99860"},"originalCharacterName":"アイビス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ibis is Eugene's new maid. Hailing from the land of water, she seems accompany Eugene wherever he goes, being one infatuated with that land. But behind her cheerful façade seems to lurk a formidable opponent who does not mince her words when it comes to her employer."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her real name is Isabelle. Her father, General Simon, was killed in battle by Eugene's inaction. Her mother and brother was executed trying to attempt a coup d'etat for revenge."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c99860"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f5/f5d91c22474c237873d644521a828cbd521284849ef4876c06a8ad41ab520e6b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0e940bf717e8199b7d1ccbc006fac511319117d027a1e2086d2dee24bf59c419.webp","width":184,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"しろたのぞみ","creatorId":"vndb:s24546","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s24546","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s24546","name":"しろたのぞみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:88075","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c99861","characterName":"シロ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c99861"},"originalCharacterName":"シロ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shiro is a member of the hero's party. Throughout the realm, she is a known spirit that accompanied the first hero 1000 years ago., but her free-spirited behavior leads to clashes with the current hero."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c99861"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/07/07951a861194ef8c4982539f12591b892d09312f96b48b195b1b791d7777a1a1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bf/bf2c249aabc7ae6ab4428cf626305cb8434350b4db2e6ee11ba2b7f6d6a5a2da.webp","width":204,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"合田 明日佳","creatorId":"vndb:s10203","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10203","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10203","name":"合田 明日佳","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:88073","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c99862","characterName":"ユージン　ラーグザン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c99862"},"originalCharacterName":"ユージン　ラーグザン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Country of Plenty's leading noble. He lives in a villa in the capital, Alard City."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c99862"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/15/15ef9fcad0ea26de0f723c40223bf2f6424d71fca9d9bf275a772ee7e48dae3a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8f/8fbdd45c87cdef1e4643ee927cf9a8e8804e69d03fd95938c8a1cfc2af58bdcb.webp","width":186,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"安芸 此葉","creatorId":"vndb:s36721","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s36721","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s36721","name":"安芸 此葉","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLa